      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "Habitats",
          "lines": [
            "Garden of Colossal Flowers"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Appearance",
          "lines": [
            "A large worker ant with prominent mandibles."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Encounters mechanics",
          "lines": [
            "Workers drawn to the flowers · The flowers cry out when a character enters a bed, about five feet from a flower. The first Giant Bumble Bee arrives the following round. The first three worker ants arrive with the fourth Giant Bumble Bee, three rounds after the first bee. Three more workers arrive each following round until 48 have come. Each ant has 11 HP.",
            "Garden boundary · They pursue and attack the party inside the garden. The workers leave the party alone outside it."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Table notes",
          "lines": [
            "The printed block describes workers and lists no poison or magic resistance.",
            "Gary Gygax, The Land Beyond the Magic Mirror (TSR, 1983), B. Garden of Colossal Flowers, p. 9."
          ]
        }
      ],
